WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.636
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind make a three-slide

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:06.131
presentation.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.707
Opening slide: introduces the topic. Main slide: shows one key idea.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.461
Image: helps communicate meaning. Closing slide: sums up the message. Rehearsal:

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:20.149
helps a presenter speak with confidence.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.620
Make a one-page paper example about your school or a Ghanaian festival. Include

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.931
opening slide, main slide and image; present it clearly to a partner.
